ORACLE-ERROR (broken upstream). `$FN(X)` with FN='ADD1' makes the sbl oracle
itself raise ERROR 022 (undefined function called) at line 13. M4 produces
empty output (no error). This benchmark is invalid as written; it is excluded
from the correctness denominator. "Working" = match the oracle's error/empty
disposition, which M4 does (empty out, rc=0). Do NOT count as a green win.
